  "Description":          "Multimodal Translation Service: the HCI Module for spoken translation with a Portable Avatar. Automatic Speech Recognition recognises the human's speech into text; Text-to-Text Translation translates it into the language named by the Language Selector; Text-To-Speech makes the Speech Object of the translation; Portable Avatar Multiplexing puts the translation, text and speech, in the Portable Avatar, which the User Agent renders. The translated text is also exposed. Non-affective; no Personal Status is supplied. Acquisition and delivery are the User Agent, not sub-AIMs.",

  "InternalTypes":        [{"Name": "RecognisedText", "DataType": "OSD-BTO-V1.5"}, {"Name": "TranslatedText", "DataType": "OSD-BTO-V1.5", "Output": 1}],

